<title>USA: Deer Park, Texas $4.120 mln won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Deer Park, Texas $4.120 mln won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated said it won $4.120 million of Deer Park, Texas general obligation limited tax bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.287 percent.</p>
</text>
